## Residuals

Bounded `SecretForms`, normal URL/`NO_PROXY` behavior, invalid UTF-8 canonicalization, and most incomplete Agent/Controller suppression passed. The green suite does not cover the five defects above.

## Task 8 branch note

Implemented the five boundary fixes on this branch:
- shared safe PUA marker selection for Agent/Bash/runtime error redaction,
- bounded dynamic-capability gate plus one shared 512-value/1 MiB collector,
- linear/bounded malformed-URL userinfo extraction,
- mandatory runtime/control-field collision suppression before provider/session mutation,
- incomplete-mode direct-identity error handling only.

Focused verification run on this branch:
